<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body {
    width: 1080px;
    height: 1920px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    background: #0a0a0f;
    color: #ffffff;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 1080px;
    height: 1920px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 12%, rgba(249,115,22,0.32), transparent 45%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 88%, rgba(180,83,9,0.36), transparent 50%),
      #0a0a0f;
  }
  .dots {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='48' height='48'><circle cx='1.5' cy='1.5' r='1.5' fill='%23f97316' opacity='0.13'/></svg>");
    background-size: 48px 48px;
  }
  .card {
    position: absolute;
    top: 70px;
    left: 50px;
    right: 50px;
    bottom: 70px;
    padding: 90px 70px;
    background: rgba(30,15,8,0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.22);
    border-radius: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 80px;
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 36px;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1.8px;
  }
  .lead .accent { color: #fdba74; }
  .sub {
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 36px;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .action {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 50px 24px;
    background: rgba(249,115,22,0.10);
    border: 2px solid #f97316;
    border-radius: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .action .emoji { font-size: 96px; line-height: 1; }
  .action .label {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fdba74;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .follow {
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .handle {
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #f97316;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="stage">
    <div class="dots"></div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="top">
        <div class="lead">
          도움 됐다면<br>
          <span class="accent">저장하고 공유</span>해주세요
        </div>
        <div class="sub">
          매일 새로운 잡지식을 받아보세요
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="actions">
        <div class="action">
          <div class="emoji">💾</div>
          <div class="label">저장</div>
        </div>
        <div class="action">
          <div class="emoji">📤</div>
          <div class="label">공유</div>
        </div>
        <div class="action">
          <div class="emoji">❤️</div>
          <div class="label">좋아요</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <div class="follow">팔로우</div>
        <div class="handle">{{handle}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
